# Vendored agent skills — upstream expo/skills (MIT), see each SKILL.md header.
# Kept byte-identical to upstream apart from the marked local edits so the copy
# stays diffable against the source; reformatting would rewrite whole files and
# bury those edits on the first refresh.
/.claude/skills/expo-animation
/.claude/skills/expo-module

# Real bookmark exports, kept byte-identical to what their producers wrote
# (packages/shared/src/import/__fixtures__/netscape/README.md). Prettier would
# reindent the tag soup that IS the thing under test — a browser's unclosed
# <DT>s, a valueless FOLDED attribute, the indentation inside a <DD> — and the
# specimens would quietly become our own HTML instead of theirs.
/packages/shared/src/import/__fixtures__/netscape
# The same, for one Raindrop.io library exported both ways
# (packages/shared/src/import/__fixtures__/raindrop/README.md).
/packages/shared/src/import/__fixtures__/raindrop

